+/* Design tokens: two layers.
+ *
+ * Skin layer (this file's first block): fonts, sizes, measure, spacing,
+ * motion. A future skin adds an `html[data-skin="x"]` block (plus an
+ * `html[data-skin="x"][data-theme="dark"]` block for dark-mode tweaks)
+ * overriding these same names. Components only read tokens, so switching
+ * skins never touches component code.
